\"is_monitoring_feeds\"), &CameraServer::is_monitoring_feeds);\n \tADD_PROPERTY(PropertyInfo(Variant::BOOL, \"monitoring_feeds\"), \"set_monitoring_feeds\", \"is_monitoring_feeds\");\n+\tADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT(\"monitoring_feeds\", false);","path":"servers/camera_server.cpp","commit_id":"e9e455823e0a6a5bd53817f1e47beb167b15aa04","original_commit_id":"8fd66f0b5edfb4c3dba48df38077239c640f3f60","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The problem is likely that when generating the documentation with `--doctool`, all documented classes are instantiated to get their default property values, which means that the constructor of `CameraTexture` will run and enable monitoring.\r\n\r\nIt might be preferable to defer it somehow, so that instantiated CameraTextures only register an intent to enable monitoring in CameraServer, and CameraServer does it on the next frame?\r\n\r\nOr we just live with this small hack, neither solution is great. It feels a bit weird to have a texture type responsible for enabling a server feature on instantiation.","created_at":"2025-04-25T09:27:52Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T09:27:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#discussion_r2059892116","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104971","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2059892116"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#discussion_r2059892116"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104971"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2059892116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":45,"original_line":45,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2052879907,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2059924146","pull_request_review_id":2793590799,"id":2059924146,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc56x_Ky","diff_hunk":"@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@ void CameraServer::_bind_methods() {\n \tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"set_monitoring_feeds\", \"is_monitoring_feeds\"), &CameraServer::set_monitoring_feeds);\n \tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"is_monitoring_feeds\"), &CameraServer::is_monitoring_feeds);\n \tADD_PROPERTY(PropertyInfo(Variant::BOOL, \"monitoring_feeds\"), \"set_monitoring_feeds\", \"is_monitoring_feeds\");\n+\tADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT(\"monitoring_feeds\", false);","path":"servers/camera_server.cpp","commit_id":"e9e455823e0a6a5bd53817f1e47beb167b15aa04","original_commit_id":"8fd66f0b5edfb4c3dba48df38077239c640f3f60","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":">  It feels a bit weird to have a texture type responsible for enabling a server feature on instantiation.\r\n\r\nYea, that's why I initially wanted to have it be 'just a hack' rather than a feature.\r\nIt would be better if Godot dropdowns somehow knew they are about to create a camera texture and enable the monitoring then, but that would require pretty substantial rewrites...\r\n\r\n> It might be preferable to defer it somehow, so that instantiated CameraTextures only register an intent to enable monitoring in CameraServer, and CameraServer does it on the next frame?\r\n\r\nI think that might be too risky for little gain 🤔 the texture would still be responsible to enable monitoring, it would just be deferred.","created_at":"2025-04-25T09:49:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T09:49:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#discussion_r2059924146","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104971","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2059924146"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#discussion_r2059924146"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104971"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2059924146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":45,"original_line":45,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2052879907,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]